# Whitelist approach: track the Paper 2 study tree (flattened to root),
# the release checksum manifest, and repo docs. Heavy regenerable data
# (raw per-null records, per-subject caches, release ZIP) stays out.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/PROVENANCE.md
!/dist/SHA256SUMS_paper2.txt

# Regenerable / heavy artifacts (reproducible from frozen seeds)
06_NULL_MODELS/null_records_checkpoint.jsonl
03_FEATURE_EXTRACTION/_per_subject_cache/
dist/*.zip
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.tmp
.pytest_cache/

# Secrets / env (defense in depth)
.env
*.pem
*.key
credentials*.json
